# Local data / scratch (scraped raw files + manifest live here and are NOT
# committed) — but curated crawl targets under data/targets/ are config and
# ARE version-controlled, and so is data/snapshots/: acquisitions that cannot
# be re-run from CI (BoardDocs 403s a datacenter IP after ~20 policies), so
# the corpus would otherwise have no way to get them. See docs/STATUS.md.
/data/*
!/data/targets/
!/data/targets/**
!/data/snapshots/
!/data/snapshots/**
/tmp/
*.sqlite
*.db


# One-off diagnostic outputs from scripts/
scripts/bertopic_output_*.md
scripts/cluster_labels_*.md
